    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h4>Working at a Family-Owned Company:</h4> <p>ZOLLER is a family-owned company that develops and manufactures innovative presetting and measuring machines, software for measurement, inspection, and management of cutting tools, and related automation solutions. Through technological innovation, a strong commitment to quality, and a genuine dedication to service, we have secured our place among the world’s leaders. We owe our success to the approximately 400 ZOLLER employees at our headquarters in Pleidelsheim near Stuttgart, as well as to the more than 400 colleagues at our branches and representative offices in 85 locations worldwide.</p> <h4>Exciting Areas of Responsibility:</h4> <p>We offer challenging and varied responsibilities, short decision-making paths, and options to help shape the company and further your career. Whether you’re an apprentice or an experienced employee—become part of the ZOLLER team.</p> <h4>International Environment:</h4> <p>At ZOLLER, customer focus isn’t just a promise—it’s a reality: We have a local sales and service presence in 62 countries.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
